{"id":"memorial_103404","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial103400","label":"Call Logs · Take care, my friend."},"label":"yyyy_mm_dd_04.mp3","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_103403","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_103404_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"I don't know if you'll ever get to hear this,"},{"id":"memorial_103404_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"but do you remember the birthday present you sent me?"},{"id":"memorial_103404_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"The solar-powered cassette player?"},{"id":"memorial_103404_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"Anyway, I put it alongside your old stash."},{"id":"memorial_103404_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"You better appreciate what I'm doing, you hear?"},{"id":"memorial_103404_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"Anyway, sorry, I'm not even sure what I'll say to you when I finally get the chance to speak with you."},{"id":"memorial_103404_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"..."},{"id":"memorial_103404_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"We had some great times together."},{"id":"memorial_103404_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_34_04_description","text":"Take care, my friend."}]}